  - provider: antigravity
    backend: cli
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Antigravity
    cli_version: 1.2.10
    last_updated: 2026-09-25
    notes:
      - Complete operator-supplied /model picker and all per-model effort screens on Antigravity CLI
        1.2.3, observed 2026-09-16; account scope is the operator's CLI.
      - "Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/antigravity-1.2.3/model-picker.success.redacted.txt"
      - "Raw execution ids re-enumerated on 1.2.10 via live agy models on 2026-09-25:
        docs/research/fixtures/antigravity-1.2.10/models-command.success.redacted.txt.
        All fourteen execution ids and label associations verified identical to 1.1.24/1.2.3."
      - One row per picker family. The first effort's verified raw id identifies each Gemini row;
        Runtime resolves model plus effort to the corresponding verified --model id. All fourteen
        executable choices remain represented.
      - No model or effort is marked default. Cats initializes to the first model and first
        applicable effort without adding a default label; existing explicit choices are preserved.
    models:
      - id: gemini-3.8-flash-low
        label: Gemini 3.8 Flash
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
          - latency_optimized
        source_names:
          - gemini-3.8-flash-low
          - Gemini 3.8 Flash
        execution:
          model: gemini-3.8-flash-low
          variants:
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: low
              model: gemini-3.8-flash-low
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: medium
              model: gemini-3.8-flash-medium
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: high
              model: gemini-3.8-flash-high
        controls:
          - key: antigravity.effort
            label: Effort
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: low
                label: low
                description: Faster responses, lighter reasoning — great for simpler tasks
              - value: medium
                label: medium
                description: Balanced speed and reasoning quality for most tasks
              - value: high
                label: high
                description: Deepest reasoning for complex problems — slower but strongest
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning
      - id: gemini-3.7-flash-low
        label: Gemini 3.7 Flash
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
          - latency_optimized
        source_names:
          - gemini-3.7-flash-low
          - Gemini 3.7 Flash
        execution:
          model: gemini-3.7-flash-low
          variants:
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: low
              model: gemini-3.7-flash-low
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: medium
              model: gemini-3.7-flash-medium
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: high
              model: gemini-3.7-flash-high
        controls:
          - key: antigravity.effort
            label: Effort
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: low
                label: low
                description: Faster responses, lighter reasoning — great for simpler tasks
              - value: medium
                label: medium
                description: Balanced speed and reasoning quality for most tasks
              - value: high
                label: high
                description: Deepest reasoning for complex problems — slower but strongest
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning
      - id: gemini-3.6-flash-low
        label: Gemini 3.6 Flash
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
          - latency_optimized
        source_names:
          - gemini-3.6-flash-low
          - Gemini 3.6 Flash
        execution:
          model: gemini-3.6-flash-low
          variants:
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: low
              model: gemini-3.6-flash-low
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: medium
              model: gemini-3.6-flash-medium
            - when:
                antigravity.effort: high
              model: gemini-3.6-flash-high
        controls:
          - key: antigravity.effort
            label: Effort
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: low
                label: low
                description: Faster responses, lighter reasoning — great for simpler tasks
              - value: medium
                label: medium
                description: Balanced speed and reasoning quality for most tasks
              - value: high
                label: high
                description: Deepest reasoning for complex problems — slower but strongest
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning
      - id: gemini-3.1-pro-low
        label: Gemini 3.1 Pro
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
          - reasoning
        source_names:
          - gemini-3.1-pro-low
          - Gemini 3.1 Pro
        execution:
