  - provider: grok
    backend: cli
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Grok
    cli_version: 1.0.41
    last_updated: 2026-09-25
    notes:
      - "Complete four-model /model list and per-model effort menus captured 2026-09-25 from Grok
        Build 1.0.41 by operating the CLI menus. UI Automation text was checked against window
        screenshots. Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/grok-1.0.41/model-picker.agent-capture.redacted.txt
        and docs/research/2026-09-25-grok-picker-agent-capture.md."
      - "Raw ids come from `grok models` and the same CLI's model cache, matched to picker labels
        by the cache name. Effort tokens come from that cache, whose labels match the picker:
        Extra High/xhigh, High/high, Medium/medium, Low/low. The session status showed (xhigh)
        while the current model's picker row showed Extra High (active)."
      - Preserve picker order and exact spelling. Omit the session markers (current) and (active)
        from labels. Descriptions stay on the model that displayed them, including the 4.7 period
        and Recommended wording versus the period-free 4.6 and 4.5 wording.
      - "No catalog default is declared. (current) was this new session's model, while config.toml
        still said grok-4.6. `grok models` printed grok-4.7 (default), so that command marker no
        longer matches the saved model default and is not copied here. (active) matched the session
        effort xhigh. The model cache marks high as default and non-session effort menus opened
        with High highlighted, but the picker shows no default marker. The 2026-09-17 first-item
        initialization policy remains: menus start at the first row without a default flag."
      - "Context 500000 was re-read from the 1.0.41 model cache for every listed model. The capture
        session header showed 500K. The cache had no output limit."
    models:
      - id: grok-4.7
        label: Grok 4.7
        limits:
          contextWindowTokens: 500000
        notes:
          - "Picker description: SpaceXAI's latest frontier model"
        source_names:
          - grok-4.7
          - Grok 4.7
        execution:
          model: grok-4.7
        controls:
          - key: grok.reasoning_effort
            label: Reasoning effort
            description: Controls Grok CLI reasoning effort for supported models.
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: xhigh
                label: Extra High
                description: Maximum reasoning for the hardest tasks.
              - value: high
                label: High
                description: Thorough reasoning and quality. Recommended.
              - value: medium
                label: Medium
                description: Strong quality with a faster turnaround.
              - value: low
                label: Low
                description: Fastest responses. Best for simple tasks.
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning_intensity
      - id: grok-4.7-build-fast
